"Percutaneous radiologic, surgical endoscopic, and percutaneous endoscopic gastrostomy/gastrojejunostomy: comparative   
study and cost analysis", "abstract": "PURPOSE To compare the results and costs of three different means of achieving   
direct percutaneous gastroenteric access. METHODS Three groups of patients received the following procedures:           
